      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you really sleep inside the aircraft?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. The cabins are built inside a converted Boeing 737-200 and an exclusive-use Boeing 727 VIP suite, each with en-suite bathrooms, air conditioning and free WiFi." }
